" end="00:30.860">to </span><span begin="00:30.860" end="00:31.350">feel</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.415" end="00:34.655"><span begin="00:32.415" end="00:32.709">How </span><span begin="00:32.709" end="00:32.924">to </span><span begin="00:32.924" end="00:33.237">call </span><span begin="00:33.237" end="00:33.512">you </span><span begin="00:33.512" end="00:33.857">by </span><span begin="00:33.857" end="00:34.182">your </span><span begin="00:34.182" end="00:34.655">name</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.813" end="00:38.236"><span begin="00:35.813" end="00:36.198">Barely </span><span begin="00:36.198" end="00:37.083">recognize </span><span begin="00:37.083" end="00:37.366">you </span><span begin="00:37.366" end="00:38.236">now</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.004" end="00:41.577"><span begin="00:39.004" end="00:39.272">All </span><span begin="00:39.272" end="00:39.536">your </span><span begin="00:39.536" end="00:39.921">words </span><span begin="00:39.921" end="00:40.135">have </span><span begin="00:40.135" end="00:40.453">turned </span><span begin="00:40.453" end="00:40.679">to </span><span begin="00:40.679" end="00:41.577">stone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.296" end="00:44.877"><span begin="00:42.296" end="00:42.641">You've </span><span begin="00:42.641" end="00:43.471">forgotten </span><span begin="00:43.471" end="00:43.765">all </span><span begin="00:43.765" end="00:44.001">my </span><span begin="00:44.001" end="00:44.877">songs</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.740" end="00:47.878"><span begin="00:45.740" end="00:46.039">You've </span><span begin="00:46.039" end="00:46.617">forgotten </span><span begin="00:46.617" end="00:47.042">all </span><span begin="00:47.042" end="00:47.355">my </span><span begin="00:47.355" end="00:47.878">love</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.797" end="00:51.326"><span begin="00:49.797" end="00:50.156">Don't </span><span begin="00:50.156" end="00:50.619">you </span><span begin="00:50.61